            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Many families hear that PCB leads to a doctor or to nothing."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Several popular courses are not BSc degrees at all."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The order is a judgement, not a rule."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:3",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Not a Rule",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "It does not follow prestige."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "How you enter: Some universities take PCB without Maths for bioinformatics."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "ranking",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:11",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Test Your Shortlist Before You Commit",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The four questions compares your options on paper."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Can you stand long shifts and patient contact, or do you prefer a bench or a screen."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A BSc that suits your energy is easier to finish well."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "test",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 11
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:12",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Backup Lanes That Keep the Year Alive",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Take the second-ranked course on your own list that passes your budget test, not the first college that says yes."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A diploma such as DMLT or a short allied-health course starts work earlier, then a lateral entry into a degree may be possible."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Bring one data or health-tech skill beside any BSc."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "backup",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 12
