      "file": "bsc-courses-after-12th-pcb-bipc-checklist.webp",
      "mobile": "bsc-courses-after-12th-pcb-bipc-checklist-mobile.webp",
      "alt": "Decision checklist for BSc Courses After 12th PCB.",
      "caption": "Questions to use before deciding.",
      "heading": "PCB Is Not a Medicine-Only Ticket",
      "content": {
        "kind": "bundle",
        "sourceNeedCount": 4,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "needId": "checklist:1",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Choose PCB Only If You Like Biology",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If you are undecided and can handle Maths, PCM keeps more doors open, although it closes medicine and some life-science routes."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If you already hold PCB or BiPC, the choice below is real: ten courses, very different ceilings."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "not-only-medicine",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "needId": "checklist:5",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Licensed Careers and Open Careers",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Nursing: you must be enrolled in a national or state register to practise."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Allied health (lab, imaging, physiotherapy, optometry, dietetics): the NCAHP Act, 2021 sets up central and state registers."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Clinical psychology: the Mental Healthcare Act asks for a recognised clinical qualification or a postgraduate degree plus a clinical M.Phil."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Government food safety posts: the FSS Rules, 2011 name the degrees."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "regulated",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 5
          },
          {
            "needId": "checklist:7",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "BSc Is a Separate Race",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Biotechnology, microbiology, zoology and botany graduates usually reach an MSc through IIT JAM or CUET PG."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A fellowship or lecturer path adds a third filter: NET, a funded PhD seat, then a scarce permanent post."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Nursing, lab technology and dietetics have a lighter second stage."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "second-stage",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 7
          },
          {
            "needId": "checklist:13",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Official Pages and Sources to Verify",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "National Commission for Allied and Healthcare Professions Act, 2021 (PRS India copy)"
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "National Nursing and Midwifery Commission Bill, 2023 (PRS India bill track)"
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
